    "https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/87CB6D0141B0DF4C2F65FFEBD183CE63/jobs/200456": {
      "title": "Adjunct- Clinical Instructor of Nursing",
      "description": "Adjunct- Clinical Instructor of Nursing You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Adjunct- Clinical Instructor of Nursing Barton College - Wilson, NC 27893 Apply Apply Description The School of Health Sciences at Barton College seeks candidates for Adjunct Clinical Instructor of Nursing. The position reports directly to the Executive Director of Nursing and Practice. Qualifications Required: Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN) from an accredited institution Hold an unrestricted license to practice as a registered nurse in North Carolina Two years of direct patient care as a registered nurse Current AHA Healthcare Provider BLS certification Strong communication and interpersonal skills with a commitment to working with students from diverse backgrounds Must complete any onboarding process required by the clinical partner Must commit to the same day once per week for the period of one semester, either Thursdays, Fridays, or Saturdays. Opportunities for more than one day per week are also available. Preferred: Master of Science (MSN) degree from an accredited institution Experience teaching pre-licensure nursing students in the clinical setting Barton College is an equal employment opportunity employer committed to a diverse faculty, staff, and student body and welcomes all applicants. Federal law requires all employers to verify the identity and employment eligibility of all persons hired to work in the United States. Any claims of discrimination for Title IX or otherwise should be directed to our Director of Title IX & Campus Relations, Corey Coley, at P.O. Box 5000, Wilson, NC 27893, or at 252-399-6319 or cocoley@barton.edu . Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
